title: Bump arkworks to 0.6, arkworks-extensions to 0.6.0, ark-scale to 0.0.14 and ark-vrf to 0.5.3

doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Bumps the arkworks crates (`ark-ec`, `ark-ff`, `ark-std` and the curve crates) from 0.5 to 0.6,
    the `arkworks-extensions` crates from 0.5.2 to 0.6.0, `ark-scale` from 0.0.13 to 0.0.14 and
    `ark-vrf` from 0.5.0 to 0.5.3. No source changes were required. The `sp-crypto-ec-utils` bump
    is major since the crate re-exports arkworks types in its public API.

crates:
- name: sp-crypto-ec-utils
  bump: major
- name: sp-core
  bump: none
- name: sp-keystore
  bump: none
